      "parameters": {
        "content": "## SLA watchdog · every 5 minutes\n\nThe piece most lead-routing builds skip. Finds assigned leads whose response deadline has passed with no first reply, then escalates them, reassigns A-tier and emergency leads to the least-loaded rep, tells the manager, and logs the breach.\n\nIf nothing is overdue, the run does nothing.",
